WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.450
Lintel 3D  ·  Worked example

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.987
Select steel with diagonal webs and inspect the full-length translucent face plates.

00:00:03.987 --> 00:00:07.321
Rotate the lintel to see the diagonals meet the top and bottom chords.

00:00:07.321 --> 00:00:09.712
Switch to opaque plates to inspect full coverage between the ends.

00:00:09.712 --> 00:00:15.120
Compare the same span without webs, then inspect the solid timber option.
